{"platform":"react-vite-static","implementationPath":{"rationale":"The MVP PDD requires a client-only React/Vite JavaScript demonstration with no backend, accounts, database, LLM generation, or external pricing integration. The operator-requested react-vite-static platform is directly compatible with that scope and with Cloudflare Pages static hosting. A small Vite React scaffold supports editable JSX source, visible validation, and deterministic in-browser calculation from the certified meal catalog and demo prices.","recommendedIde":"VS Code","recommendedVibe":"VIBE DJ: keep a compact static React app with calculation logic isolated in plain JavaScript utilities, no extra libraries beyond React/Vite, and manual acceptance checks driven by the MVP examples.","hostingRationale":"Cloudflare Pages fits a static client-only Vite bundle with no server requirements. Advisory caveat: this conversion does not claim build, test, or deployment execution. If Pages-specific deployment is deferred, the same generated static bundle remains portable to other static hosts later, subject to governance and later gates.","requirementTrace":["Objective -> src/App.jsx and src/planner.js","I/O contract -> src/App.jsx validation and src/planner.js input checks","Pricing and provenance -> src/data.js and disclaimer text in src/App.jsx","Calculation -> src/planner.js deterministic seven-day aggregation","Success criteria -> src/planner.js status branching and src/App.jsx result rendering","Acceptance examples -> README.md manual checks","Delivery scope -> package.json, vite.config.js, README.md, static client-only file set"]},"collaboration":{"oracle":[{"requirement":"I/O contract","gap":"Visible rejection for missing, non-integer, and out-of-range inputs could be omitted if form parsing silently coerced values.","resolution":"CODE_CHANGE"},{"requirement":"Success criteria","gap":"Insufficient-budget outcome must return empty days and shoppingList while still showing the same calculated total and required budget.","resolution":"CODE_CHANGE"},{"requirement":"Pricing and provenance","gap":"The mandated demonstration-prices disclaimer and prohibition on external/live pricing could be missed in UI text.","resolution":"CODE_CHANGE"},{"requirement":"Delivery scope","gap":"Host compatibility and static-only delivery needed concrete Vite/Cloudflare-compatible scaffold files without adding credentials or services.","resolution":"CODE_CHANGE"}],"dj":[{"requirement":"I/O contract","change":"Added explicit integer and range validation with visible error rendering; no silent clamping or coercive acceptance.","files":["src/App.jsx","src/planner.js"]},{"requirement":"Success criteria","change":"Implemented deterministic planner logic that always computes totalCostCents/requiredBudgetCents and returns empty days/shoppingList for insufficient budgets.","files":["src/planner.js","src/App.jsx"]},{"requirement":"Pricing and provenance","change":"Added authoritative local catalog/prices module and rendered the exact demonstration-only disclaimer in the interface.","files":["src/data.js","src/App.jsx"]},{"requirement":"Delivery scope","change":"Created a compact React/Vite static scaffold and README with setup/manual acceptance checks, without secrets or deployment claims.","files":["package.json","vite.config.js","index.html","src/main.jsx","README.md"]}]},"framework":"React 19 + Vite","language":"javascript","files":[{"path":"package.json","language":"javascript","content":"{
